	(descr "Raspberry Pi Pico 2 (RP2350) / Pico (RP2040) module - 2x20 0.1in headers, 0.7in row spacing, 51x21mm body. Pin 1 (GP0) and pin 40 (VBUS) are both at the USB-C end (-X); pins 20/21 are both at the far end, matching the module's winding order. Pin 1 pad is square. NOTE: the Pico's 3-pin SWD debug pads are deliberately NOT modelled here - wire them to a separate 3-pin header on the carrier board rather than encoding an unverified offset into copper.")
